<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy | Active Agent" %>

<section class="legal-section">
  <div class="legal-container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="paragraph s tertiary">Last updated: August 27, 2026</p>

    <p class="paragraph m secondary">
      Active Agent ("we", "us") provides observability and tooling for AI agents
      built on Ruby on Rails. This policy explains what we collect, why, and what
      control you have over it.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul class="legal-list">
      <li><strong>Account information.</strong> Your email address, and the name and workspace details you provide when you register.</li>
      <li><strong>Telemetry data.</strong> Traces, spans, token counts, latency, model names, and cost data that your applications send to our ingestion endpoint. This may include prompt and completion content that you choose to transmit.</li>
      <li><strong>Inquiry information.</strong> Name, email, company, and message content when you contact us about workshops, advisory, or development services.</li>
      <li><strong>Usage data.</strong> Standard server logs, including IP address, browser type, and pages viewed.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul class="legal-list">
      <li>To operate the platform, display your traces, and enforce plan limits.</li>
      <li>To send transactional email such as verification and billing notices.</li>
      <li>To respond to sales and consulting inquiries you initiate.</li>
      <li>To send product updates, where you have opted in. Every marketing email includes an unsubscribe link.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Telemetry and your customers' data</h2>
    <p class="paragraph m secondary">
      You control what your agents transmit. Prompt and completion payloads are
      only stored if you send them. We do not use customer telemetry to train
      models, and we do not sell it. Retention is governed by your plan; data
      past the retention window is deleted on a rolling basis.
    </p>

    <h2>Service providers</h2>
    <p class="paragraph m secondary">
      We share data only with providers necessary to run the service, including
      Google Cloud Platform (hosting and database), Stripe (payments), and Resend
      (email delivery). Each processes data on our behalf under their own terms.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p class="paragraph m secondary">
      You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data
      at any time by emailing
      <%= link_to "privacy@activeagents.ai", "mailto:privacy@activeagents.ai" %>.
      Deleting your account removes your workspaces and associated telemetry.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p class="paragraph m secondary">
      Data is encrypted in transit and at rest. API keys and provider credentials
      are encrypted at the application layer. Access to production systems is
      restricted to authorized personnel.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p class="paragraph m secondary">
      Questions about this policy? Email
      <%= link_to "privacy@activeagents.ai", "mailto:privacy@activeagents.ai" %>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
